# Day 30 - Enterprise AI Assistant 

Built the first working RAG backend using Spring Boot, LangChain4j and Groq.

## What I built

- Spring Boot REST API
- LangChain4j integration
- Groq LLM
- Document ingestion
- Document chunking
- Local embeddings
- In-memory vector store
- Semantic vector search
- RAG pipeline

## RAG Flow

Document
↓
Chunking
↓
Embeddings
↓
Vector Store
↓
Semantic Search
↓
Relevant Context
↓
Groq
↓
Final Answer

## API

GET /api/search

GET /api/rag

## Next

Starting Spring AI and gradually migrating the AI functionality to Spring AI.
